		<div class="topic" id="forum_op_topic_574927167599683127">
		Neutron Generator bug	</div>
	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_574927167599683127">
		I think neutron generators timing may be bugged, no matter the timing value it appears to be firing the instant the sim starts	</div>
		
	<div class="forum_op_footer">
		<div></div>
