			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_574927167599688312">
				Had the same problem, on 3-1, the first plutonium experiment it changed the detonator times from measuring in MS to PS, changing the timing to the same whole number in PS worked, not sure why it's designed this way			</div>
			<div class="comment_footer_ctn">
